DISCLAIMER FOR RESUME SCREENING AI:

This software is intended for educational and research purposes. When using 
this software for actual recruitment or hiring processes:

1. Ensure compliance with local employment laws and anti-discrimination regulations
2. Use AI predictions as assistive tools, not sole decision-making criteria
3. Maintain human oversight in all hiring decisions
4. Regularly audit for bias and fairness in predictions
5. Protect candidate privacy and personal data according to applicable data 
   protection regulations (GDPR, CCPA, etc.)

The authors and contributors of this software are not responsible for any 
discriminatory outcomes or legal issues arising from its use in actual 
hiring processes.